            <ArticleTitle>A new species of the genus Phaenochilus Weise from China (Coleoptera, Coccinellidae, Chilocorini).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3897/zookeys.644.9825</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new species Phaenochilus albomarginalis Li &amp; Wang, sp. n. is described. The only other species recorded from China is Phaenochilus metasternalis Miyatake, 1970 and it is described here for comparison. Diagnoses, detailed descriptions, illustrations, and distributions are provided.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
